Is that fair?

00:11:51.531 --> 00:11:54.360
It's more tender texture, tender fibers.

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:55.193
Yup.

00:11:55.193 --> 00:11:58.030
So what we've done is
different types of textures.

00:11:58.030 --> 00:11:59.080
We can make thicker fibers,

00:11:59.080 --> 00:12:02.010
